    <briefdescription>
<para>Full OpenTelemetry integration tracer (v1.6.0). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements <computeroutput>ITracer</computeroutput> with complete W3C Trace Context and W3C Baggage propagation, configurable exporter back-ends, and higher-level helpers for exception recording and metric attachment.</para>
<para>The tracer is <bold>non-copyable</bold> but movable (via std::unique_ptr wrapping). All methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
